      # Match nvim's tree-sitter colours where one-dark-pro's own selectors
      # out-rank the generic table. Headings (H1 $num, others $fn) and bullet mirror theme-sync's markdown.
      # bright = markdown bold; hunk's scope table carries colour only, no weight.
